Add '--protocol', 'http2'. But better: make it overridable via env so a user with a working UDP path can go back to quic. Keep it simple but allow override: `const CF_PROTOCOL = process.env.HUB_TUNNEL_PROTOCOL || 'http2';`

That matches repo style (env-driven config everywhere). Let me implement.

